title: "Myelinate: an open-source learning skill suite"
type: software
version: 2.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-11
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An open-source Claude Code plugin and agent skill suite that makes an AI
  assistant a Socratic tutor and teacher: course tutoring, assignment coaching,
  tests and grading, labs, flashcards and study plans. Honest, not agreeable.
  Its own effect on learning has not been established.
